<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>#(title)</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
  <script>
    function setUrl() {
      document.getElementById('url').value = window.location.href;
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>#(title)</h1>
  <h3><strong>Character Details:</strong></h3>
  <table border="1">
    <tr>
      <th>Name</th>
      <td>#(characterName)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Gender</th>
      <td>#(characterGender)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Fighting Specialty</th>
      <td>#(fightingSpecialty)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Armor Class</th>
      <td>#(armorClass)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Home Planet</th>
      <td>#(homePlanet)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Weapon</th>
      <td>#(weapon)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Money</th>
      <td>#(money)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Inventory</th>
      <td>#(inventory)</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  <br>
  #if(choice == "option1"):
    <p>You cough out an "OKAY!" *AUH AUGH CHOGH* as he lets you down onto the marble.</p>
    <p>You cough for a minute, holding your hands to your neck as the shark tank glass slides back over.</p>
    <p>Not before an errant laser beams out, vaporizing a nearby guard's shoulder before bouncing into the ceiling.</p>
    <br>
    <p>"I knew you would come to your senses, mortal."</p>
    <br>
    <p>The next few years are a blur. You swear they are putting something in your food, but with the amount and quality of it that you are getting, you do not care.</p>
    <p>You are appointed as High Populi Generalis. You grow angrier yet more docile as the years go on.</p>
    <p>You lead campaigns on planets you have never heard of. You obtain more war medals than can fit on your shiny pyrite armor.</p>
    <p>Your #(weapon) has seen more skulls than you could have ever dreamed of, and you have led more people to agony than you are fit to know.</p>
    <p>This feels great.</p>
    <p>Your sorrows of being enslaved and being a gladiator fade. You no longer remember how the emperor killed your people, enslaved your family.</p>
    <p>You don't care. You are happy. You are a god. And you feel like it.</p>
    <p>All thanks to The Emperor.</p>
    <br>
    <h3><strong>The end...? You achieved the hacker Emperor's Pet ending!</strong></h3>
  #endif
  #if(choice == "option2"):
    <p>You cannot live a life devoted to an imperialistic galaxy destroying maniac.</p>
    <p>This is the moment you have waited for your whole life.</p>
    <br>
    <p>You grab above your head onto his arms, and throw your feet back directly into his groin.</p>
    <p>He emits a yelp of pain as his arm lets you go.</p>
    <p>Your weight centers around your hands, and you hold on to his robe for dear life as both of you tumble into the shark tank.</p>
    <br>
    <p>You see The Emperor, flailing in the water, be engulfed and swarmed by a pack of sharks, lasering and chomping him.</p>
    <p>This is your last sight, as you see an oncoming laser racing towards you.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Your last pain-filled thoughts are good thoughts. You know you have done the empire a service. </p>
    <p>You snuffed out the man who enslaved millions, and killed billions. </p>
    <p>You don't know what the empire possibly will be like without The Emperor. Maybe it returns to harmony, as it was 5000 years ago before he took power.</p>
    <p>Maybe it all crumbles. Maybe a new emperor arises. </p>
    <p>All that you know is that you did good.</p>
    <p>You did good. Fascism may no longer reign over the people of the galaxy. May.</p>
    <br>
    <h3><strong>You achieved the hacker emperor slaying ending! Congratulations! The universe thanks you for your contribution.</strong></h3>
  #endif
</body>
</html>